

* run `autoscan`

```shell
autoscan
```

* move `configure.scan` to `configure.ac` & edit `configure.ac`
* support automake

```shell
touch AUTHORS ChangeLog NEWS README Makefile.am
```







* srcdir
* top_srcdir


* bin_PROGRAMS
* sbin_PROGRAMS
* noinst_PROGRAMS
* lib_LIBRARIES
* noinst_LIBRARIES
* lib_LTLIBRARIES
* noinst_LTLIBRARIES
* include_HEADERS
* SUBDIRS


* @target@_SOURCES
* @target@_LIBADD
* @target@_LBADD
* @target@_CFLAGS
* @target@_CPPFLAGS
* @target@_CPPFLAGS
* @target@_LDFLAGS



